# AtlasDocs wordmark colors

The `Docs` part of the AtlasDocs wordmark must preserve the official per-letter color progression rather than using a single uniform color or a CSS gradient across the whole word.

Use:

- D: `#214FC8` (`--atlas-docs-d`)
- o: `#1A6DC2` (`--atlas-docs-o`)
- c: `#1A84BD` (`--atlas-docs-c`)
- s: `#1EA6B1` (`--atlas-docs-s`)

`Atlas` remains the existing dark navy brand color (`--brand-900`).

Create this once in the shared `AtlasDocsWordmark` component and reuse it everywhere the branded product wordmark is displayed.

Do not reproduce this styling for ordinary occurrences of "AtlasDocs" inside body text.
